+If your server has TimescaleDB (in `shared_preload_libraries`), run
+`CREATE EXTENSION timescaledb;` in the database once (as a superuser) and
+start the stack again: debcontrol notices the extension and sets up its
+history tables the same way as on the bundled TimescaleDB.
+
